before the next day.`}`}function Fi(){return[`Demonstration vehicle specs reviewed August 2026 — not live inventory or a purchase recommendation.`,`Trade-kit weights are modeled estimates reviewed September 2026 — not a scale ticket from a real truck.`,`Driving energy uses about 48 kWh per 100 miles, then scales up with towing and cargo/kit mass.`,`Trailer shape/drag uses WattReach field presets when a class is known (travel trailer, enclosed box, toy hauler). Weight-only was optimistic versus their ${Lr.headline.weightedAverageMiPerKwh} mi/kWh Airstream average (~${Lr.headline.estimatedFullPackTowingRangeMi} mi on a ${Lr.rig.usablePackKwh} kWh pack). ${Ir}.`,`Each stop adds about ${li} kWh for start-stop and short idle — not measured idle data.`,`In-bed cargo and trade-kit weight use a separate ~${Math.round(yi*100)}% range derate at payload rating — not the trailer curve. Electrical tool kWh is counted separately.`,`Weather, hills, traffic, and cabin HVAC are not modeled here.`,`Operating-cost comparison is fuel + maintenance only (ICE $${ui}/yr, EV $400/yr demo allowances). Financing the replacement truck is not included.`,`Unknown charging is modeled conservatively: about 70% start charge and no assumed overnight or daytime charger. It is not a precise home or shop model.`,`Bed-accessory upfit prices are demo ballparks (list / street sheets reviewed September 2026), not an installed quote.`,`A selected overflow trailer uses a FACT-ish empty curb weight plus the kit/bed cargo that moved off the bed. Towing is checked against that total. Leftover bed load (people / leftover cargo) is still payload. Bed overflow does not auto-disqualify cargo that moved to the trailer.`,`These numbers are directional estimates. They should not be read as more precise than the demo data supports.`]}function Ii({configRange:e,dailyMiles:t,stops:n,trailerWeight:r,towingCapacity:i,payloadWeight:a,payloadCapacity:o,charging:s,equipmentItems:c=[],categoryScore:l,categoryLabel:u,vehicleId